WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.520
Speaker 1: Mitt Romney is blasting Marjorie&nbsp;
Taylor GREENE on her secession insanity. We're&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:10.260
going to look at a short clip. Remember that&nbsp;
Marjorie Taylor GREENE last week said that we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:14.520
need a national divorce where we divide up into&nbsp;
red states and blue states. I told you all of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:19.080
the reasons why that makes no sense. Senator&nbsp;
Mitt Romney, a Republican, was asked about it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:23.160
and here's what he had to say. Senator, what do&nbsp;
you think about Representative Marjorie Taylor?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:29.700
GREENE this call on social media for a national&nbsp;
to divorce dividing the country. Republican&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:33.960
and Democrat Democratic states. You know, I&nbsp;
think Abraham Lincoln dealt with that kind of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:39.480
insanity. We're not going to divide the country.&nbsp;
