00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:45.060
listen, I didn't vote for Mitt Romney, but he does&nbsp;
seem like a fundamentally decent and honest guy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:50.220
who just tells you what he thinks. And he thinks a&nbsp;
