00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:28.860
If we had more Republicans like Mitt Romney, the&nbsp;
Republican Party would be just a party would we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:37.320
disagree with on policy and less of the scourge or&nbsp;
